WEBVTT

00:01:28.482 --> 00:01:31.157
They didn't know how to.

00:01:31.181 --> 00:01:36.936
Discoveries like fire happened so rarely

00:01:36.960 --> 00:01:39.302
that, from an individual's point of view,

00:01:39.326 --> 00:01:42.141
the world never improved.

00:01:42.165 --> 00:01:44.907
Nothing new was learned.

00:01:45.929 --> 00:01:49.607
The first clue to the origin of starlight

00:01:49.631 --> 00:01:54.085
happened as recently as 1899:

00:01:54.109 --> 00:01:55.358
radioactivity.

00:01:56.096 --> 00:01:58.160
And within 40 years,

00:01:58.184 --> 00:02:01.976
physicists discovered
the whole explanation,